 tower. It is located at the junction of Chatham Street and Janadhipathi Mawatha in Colombo fort.", "extract_html": "<p><b>Old Colombo Lighthouse</b> or <b>Colombo Fort Clock Tower</b> is a clock tower and was a lighthouse in Colombo. The lighthouse is no longer operational, but the tower remains and functions as a clock tower. It is located at the junction of Chatham Street and Janadhipathi Mawatha in Colombo fort.</p>"}